umber":1,"title":"2.5.0","description":"Enhancements and bug fixes expected to be included in the next main release.","creator":{"login":"thc202","id":4639210,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzkyMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4639210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202","html_url":"https://github.com/thc202","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thc202/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":152,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-01-06T16:25:24Z","updated_at":"2016-10-04T09:53:40Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2016-06-04T18:07:32Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2016-04-21T12:32:52Z","updated_at":"2020-02-01T20:23:46Z","closed_at":"2016-04-22T08:37:10Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"From OWASP ZAP User Group: https://groups.google.com/d/topic/zaproxy-users/AlT3gpxale8/discussion\n\n---\n\nSteps to reproduce the issue:\n1. Run ZAP with \"Active scanner rules (beta)\" add-on (v19) installed (easier to reproduce the issue);\n2. Change the \"Default Policy\" to disable all scanners except \"Heartbleed OpenSSL Vulnerability\", \"Source Code Disclosure - /WEB-INF folder\" and \"Cross-Domain Misconfiguration\";\n3. Start the active scan against a target;\n4. Once finished see the number of requests sent by each scanner (using the GUI, \"Scan Progress\" dialogue, or the ZAP API, http://zap/HTML/ascan/view/scanProgress/?scanId=0) and note that the count does not correspond to the messages sent by each scanner. For example, in the attached screen capture, the scanners \"Source Code Disclosure - /WEB-INF folder\" and \"Cross-Domain Misconfiguration\" have 0 messages while \"Heartbleed OpenSSL Vulnerability\" has 9, but from the messages sent:\n\n```\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/web.xml\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/applicationContext.xml\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/classes/2/0.class\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/classes/web/xml.class\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/classes/2/4/7.class\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/classes/example/com.class\nhttp://example.com/WEB-INF/classes/applicationContext/xml.class\nhttp://example.com/crossdomain.xml\nhttp://example.com/clientaccesspolicy.xml\n```\n\nthe scanner \"Source Code Disclosure - /WEB-INF folder\" sent 7 and \"Cross-Domain Misconfiguration\" sent 2.\n\nRemarks;\nMessages sent during the analysis step, before any active scanner has been run, will be counted as sent by the first scanner run.\n\nZAP Versions:\nVersion >= 2.4.3.\n\n---\n\n![Request Count Mismatch](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/4639210/14708753/c8e821b0-07c4-11e6-83d6-852c64d090cf.png)\n","closed_by":{"login":"kingthorin","id":7570458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1NzA0NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7570458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingthorin","html_url":"https://github.com/kingthorin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingthorin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingthorin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingthorin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kingthorin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a